---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Window from '../components/Window.astro';
import MobileTitlebar from '../components/MobileTitlebar.astro';
---

<AppLayout
  title="Squash · Ishan Rajpurohit"
  description="Why squash takes up Ishan Rajpurohit's evenings."
>
  <Window title="Squash" height={738} transitionName="active-window">
    <div class="squash-content">
      <div class="squash-text">
        <h1>Squash takes up my evenings.</h1>
        <div class="squash-body">
          <p>Between design projects and engineering classes, you&rsquo;ll usually find me on a squash court in the evenings.</p>
          <p>I started playing in early 2025, and what began as curiosity quickly became one of the most rewarding parts of my routine.</p>
          <p>Squash has taught me far more than how to hit a ball. It&rsquo;s taught me consistency, patience, and that small improvements compound over time. More importantly, it&rsquo;s introduced me to a community that makes every practice worth showing up for.</p>
          <p>I&rsquo;ll probably always have a squash racquet leaning somewhere near my desk.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="squash-image">
        <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-collage.png" alt="Playing squash on court" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Window>

  <Fragment slot="mobile">
    <MobileTitlebar title="Squash" />
    <div class="m-squash">
      <div class="m-squash-image">
        <img src="/images/hobbies/squash-collage.png" alt="Playing squash on court" />
      </div>
      <h1>Squash takes up my evenings.</h1>
      <div class="m-squash-body">
        <p>Between design projects and engineering classes, you&rsquo;ll usually find me on a squash court in the evenings.</p>
        <p>I started playing in early 2025, and what began as curiosity quickly became one of the most rewarding parts of my routine.</p>
        <p>Squash has taught me far more than how to hit a ball. It&rsquo;s taught me consistency, patience, and that small improvements compound over time. More importantly, it&rsquo;s introduced me to a community that makes every practice worth showing up for.</p>
        <p>I&rsquo;ll probably always have a squash racquet leaning somewhere near my desk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</AppLayout>

<style>
  .squash-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 72px 64px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .squash-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    width: 653px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .squash-text h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #000;
  }

  .squash-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .squash-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: normal;
    color: #443a3a;
  }

  .squash-image {
    width: 191px;
    height: 526px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .squash-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .m-squash {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .m-squash-image {
    width: 60%;
    max-width: 220px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    aspect-ratio: 191 / 526;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .m-squash-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .m-squash h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #000;
  }

  .m-squash-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .m-squash-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #443a3a;
  }
</style>
